<BaseLayout title="About | Boreal Plating" description="Discover Boreal's trajectory since 1988, its industrial evolution, principles and commitment to quality." lang="en" path="/en/about/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="ABOUT" title="A trajectory built on experience, precision and evolution." description="Since 1988, technical knowledge and attention to detail have shaped how Boreal develops industrial solutions." image="/images/historia-sede.webp" imageAlt="Historical aerial view of the Boreal facility" />
  <section class="section"><div class="container intro-grid reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR HISTORY</p><h2>From the first site to today's industrial operation.</h2></div><div class="intro-copy"><p>Founded in Joinville by two chemical engineers, Boreal began with close involvement in every stage of the process. Over time, it expanded into the electronics, home-appliance, construction, automotive and aerospace sectors.</p><p>In 1998, Boreal opened its current facility on Rua Tuiuti, consolidating its regional presence and expanding its capabilities, processes and long-term customer relationships.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-tight section-ice"><div class="container"><div class="timeline"><article class="timeline-item reveal"><time>1988</time><div><h3>The journey begins</h3><p>Boreal starts operating in Joinville, combining chemical knowledge and surface-treatment expertise.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-item reveal"><time>1989</time><div><h3>Knowledge in motion</h3><p>The founders attend EBRATS, strengthening the company's connection with technical developments in the field.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-item reveal"><time>1998</time><div><h3>A new industrial facility</h3><p>The current facility opens on Rua Tuiuti, increasing operating capacity.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-item reveal"><time>Today</time><div><h3>Integrated processes</h3><p>Boreal combines engineering, manufacturing, machining, injection molding and surface treatment for demanding projects.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="heading-row reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDUSTRIAL MEMORY</p><h2>Images that record Boreal's evolution.</h2></div></div><div class="photo-grid"><figure class="wide reveal"><img src="/images/historia-terreno.webp" alt="Land for Boreal's future facilities" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The site for the future facility in the late 1990s.</figcaption></figure><figure class="reveal"><img src="/images/historia-instalacoes.webp" alt="Sign announcing Boreal's future facilities" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Planning the current facility.</figcaption></figure><figure class="reveal"><img src="/images/historia-construcao.webp" alt="Construction of Boreal's current plant" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Construction of the industrial plant.</figcaption></figure><figure class="wide reveal"><img src="/images/historia-sede.webp" alt="Aerial view of the Boreal facility in 2000" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Aerial view recorded in 2000.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><div class="heading-row reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow light">IDENTITY</p><h2>Principles that guide decisions and relationships.</h2></div></div><div class="values-grid"><article class="value-card reveal"><h3>Mission</h3><p>Provide solutions in parts, subassemblies and systems, with or without specific surface finishes and treatments, delivering assured quality.</p></article><article class="value-card reveal"><h3>Vision</h3><p>Be recognized for technological development, quality and high aesthetic standards in supply, assembly and surface treatment.</p></article><article class="value-card reveal"><h3>Values</h3><p>Respect for life, ethics, the law, customers, suppliers, people and the environment.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split reverse"><div class="media-frame reveal"><img src="/images/fachada-boreal.webp" alt="Boreal Plating's current facility in Joinville" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">QUALITY POLICY</p><h2>A formal commitment to continual improvement.</h2><p>Provide injection-molded products and metallic surface-treatment services through electrolytic and chemical processes that meet quality criteria and customer requirements, while continually improving processes and products.</p></div></div></section><CTA lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>
